"CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_NONSTREAMING_FALLBACK=1 keeps retries on the streaming path, which matches a "
"gateway with SSE heartbeats. On 15 September, a 99.6k-token session received 400 because a non-"
"streaming fallback carried 98,678 estimated input tokens into the 90-second JSON endpoint; this "
"variable addresses that exact mechanism."

